  "thag1.102:0.4": "2. Setucchattheragāthā 102. ",
  "thag1.102:1.1": "‘‘Mānena vañcitāse, ",
  "thag1.102:1.2": "saṅkhāresu saṃkilissamānāse; ",
  "thag1.102:1.3": "Lābhālābhena mathitā, ",
  "thag1.102:1.4": "samādhiṃ nādhigacchantī’’ti. … ",
  "thag1.102:1.5": "Setuccho thero…. "
}
